00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:16.869
sanity. I'll just say this, if you ever have
to edit on a laptop. Don't forget your mouse,

00:00:16.869 --> 00:00:18.539
it won't go well.

00:00:18.539 --> 00:00:22.050
Hello to all the new people, if you're just
finding me I'm doing weekly Korra videos.

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.760
Be sure to subscribe to get everything. I'll
be doing bonus videos, episode reviews and

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:28.769
Q&amp;As. Next week is weird because there's no
new episode. Two more weeks before Episode

00:00:28.769 --> 00:00:30.330
4 airs on July 11th.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:37.330
Also, the giveaway is also good for this video
too. All you have to do to participate is

00:00:39.579 --> 00:00:44.290
be a subscriber and leave a comment on this
video. I'll be picking one random person from

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:44.570
the comments and announcing who it is next
week.

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:46.350
So this will be just like my episode 1 and
2 review except I'm just doing TOP 5 moments

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:49.670
and then my review. This is all mostly going
to revolve around The Earth Queen, the Dai

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:53.449
Lee and the shady business in Ba Sing Se.
Careful for spoilers from the episode if you

00:00:53.449 --> 00:00:55.030
haven't seen it yet.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:01:00.180
Everybody ready? Okay, here we go, Number
5 - Mako and Bolin are too good for rotten

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:01.109
fruit

00:01:01.109 --> 00:01:04.250
When you look at all the different storylines
in the episode, I feel like Mako and Bolin

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.500
reconnecting with their family was every bit
as important as Korra getting the Earth Queen's

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:13.000
help. And on top of it all, Mike and Bryan
tied them getting stuck in the Lower Ring

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.860
to the Dai Li. In case you blinked you may
have missed them standing there looking for

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:22.470
more new airbenders.

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:26.710
It's pretty easy to understand how they could
have gotten disconnected from their extended

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:30.549
family. Technically they had never met them.
Their father was the Earthbender, Saan. He

00:01:30.549 --> 00:01:35.009
left to make his way in the world and fell
in love with a Firebender, their mother. So

00:01:35.009 --> 00:01:38.590
they weren't born in Ba Sing Se and since
their parents died when they were little kids,

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:40.600
they never new their cousins existed.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:44.509
Whenever Bolin was convincing Mako to drift
his way back to the group he said they were

00:01:44.509 --> 00:01:48.659
going to visit Grandma, so at some point they
would have had to learn about each other.

00:01:48.659 --> 00:01:54.210
I may have missed it, but I think it was because
Bolin's Nuktuk Movers were being screened

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:57.770
in Ba Sing Se and his Grandmother knew who
they were.

00:01:57.770 --> 00:02:03.600
But however they did connect, I'm interested
to see if their cousin, the Rotten Fruit vendor,

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:06.409
ends up helping them free the airbenders.

00:02:06.409 --> 00:02:10.429
The Dai Li plot and the Earth Queen secret
army was kind of teased during the dinner,

00:02:10.429 --> 00:02:13.430
but right now, there isn't really a reason
for their family to fight with them. And their

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:17.650
Grandmother even got really weird when they
spoke ill of the Queen. Like she was a little

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:20.310
brainwashed, which reminds me of the Dai Li
in last airbender.

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:23.860
In case you didn't notice, their Grandmother
was the same girl that had a crush on Zuko

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:28.230
during the Ba Sing Se episodes of Last Airbender.

00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:31.800
Number 4 - Korra and Asami Learn about the
plight of the people

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:36.150
While they were out tax collecting during
the battle, mr hockey mask calls it out. The

00:02:36.150 --> 00:02:40.280
Queen is wrongfully taxing her citizens. At
some point this season, that will have to

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:44.370
be dealt with, but I'm not expecting it to
happen anytime soon. They introduced too many

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:47.989
new plot threads to resolve anything completely
in the next episode.

00:02:47.989 --> 00:02:51.959
Korra is probably just going to keep poking
at the Earth Queen until she gets her to snap

00:02:51.959 --> 00:02:56.550
and unleash the Dai Li on her. They did already
take Kai, but that was incidental. They didn't

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:59.519
know he was connected with the Avatar when
they targeted him.

00:02:59.519 --> 00:03:06.280
The taxation is just the surface level problem,
I'm assuming she's using all that money to

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:09.209
support the huge army she's trying to build
in secret. So Korra is going to have to solve

00:03:09.209 --> 00:03:12.080
all the Earth Kingdom problems by first dealing
with the Airbender kidnapping crisis.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.430
Number 3 - The new Earth Queen is a real Bitch

00:03:14.430 --> 00:03:19.640
Big 180 from her father the Earth King from
Last Airbender. She seems like an Azula-type

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:23.769
person who just doesn't have bending. So I
can totally imagine her dominating her father

00:03:23.769 --> 00:03:26.470
while she was growing up, just doing whatever
she wanted.

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:30.830
She's totally nutters, but I'm wondering if
she'll have an "Azula Goes Crazy" moment.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:32.700
Where she just absolutely snaps.

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:37.489
In her defence, when she was explaining some
of her gripes to Korra. Zuko and Aang technically

00:03:37.489 --> 00:03:42.659
did take her land to build Republic City.
But this is what happened. The used land that

00:03:42.659 --> 00:03:47.010
the Fire Nation had taken from the Earth Kingdom
to build colonies during the war of invasion.

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:51.959
So it's only natural that Zuko would use that
Land to make a city dedicated to peace. But

00:03:51.959 --> 00:03:56.519
it's like stealing 5 dollars from your neighbor,
then donating the 5 dollars to charity. Yes

00:03:56.519 --> 00:04:00.980
you did something good, but you achieved it
with stolen merch. So the Earth Queen's argument

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:02.000
is valid.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:06.150
I could totally see her marching an airbending
army on Republic City trying to take it back

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:09.760
in the name of the Earth Kingdom. Imagine
the spirits living there now going to war

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:16.760
with them. It would be like the Avatar Wan
episodes all over again.

00:04:17.659 --> 00:04:20.269
It's unclear why she felt the need to build
the airbender army in the first place, but

00:04:20.269 --> 00:04:25.380
it's possible the Dai Li are manipulating
her just like her father and it's just not

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:28.169
as obvious because she seems so self assured
and stubborn.

00:04:28.169 --> 00:04:30.630
Number 2 - Korasami Ass Kicking

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:34.330
I got such a good vibe from their fight. I
wonder what the dynamic would have been had

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:38.720
Korra been the first person to bump into Asami
instead of Mako and they never did all the

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:40.669
romance stuff in books 1 and 2.

00:04:40.669 --> 00:04:46.660
I love the implied 'ships, just because it's
funny as subtext, but I can totally do without

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:51.710
full on teen romance. I get the general sense
that all of you guys are pretty pumped for

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:56.500
Korasami this year. With Naga they're like
a whole Scooby Doo team all by themselves.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:05:01.090
In that situation Korra would definitely be
like a cross between Shaggy and Fred and Asami

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:03.759
would be like a cross between Velma and Daphne.

00:05:03.759 --> 00:05:07.970
It's like they have all the good qualities,
the brains and the courage, but at the same

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:14.410
time they're super awkward. Which is totally
going to make Book 3 so much more fun.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:18.000
If any of you are graphic artists and want
to send me some fanart of Korra Asami and

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:22.160
Naga as the Scooby Doo gang I'll be sure to
add it in my bonus video next Friday.

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:26.720
and my Number 1 moment - The Dai Li is building
a Secret Airbending Army

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:31.520
So many questions here, we can only assume
that since the Earth King disbanded the Dai

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:36.229
Li during Last Airbender, they somehow resurfaced
and ingratiated themselves with the Earth

00:05:36.229 --> 00:05:40.900
Queen. It's possible that they rebuilt themselves
under the guise of 'new leadership' and have

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:44.509
just been running another long con involving
her or taking advantage of her.

00:05:44.509 --> 00:05:48.190
I know in Last Airbender they were using the
King as a puppet, but it's totally possible

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:52.870
the Earth Queen is complicit in their shady
business. It all depends on what the motivation

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:57.169
is for building the army. And I think it has
something to do with what Zaheer was saying

00:05:57.169 --> 00:05:58.120
when he escaped.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:02.069
About closing your mind to the possibility
of a new reality. The Queen probably wants

00:06:02.069 --> 00:06:06.199
to either take back her land or just use the
army to keep the raiding parties from stealing

00:06:06.199 --> 00:06:11.960
back the gold she's taking. That seems more
and more like a Robin Hood plot point, the

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:12.180
raiders.

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:16.900
Whenever they met Kai, we got the whole "Looks
can be deceiving" speech, so I won't be surprised

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:20.169
if all the raiders are really just freedom
fighters trying to help the people.

00:06:20.169 --> 00:06:24.720
But now it's your turn, let me know what your
favorite moment was. I mistakenly talked about

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:29.340
the bending twins and zuko during my last
video, I just forgot they were part of this

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:30.630
third episode, that's why I left them out
of this. Otherwise they would have been like

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:32.850
my second favorite moment.

